Bharata scorns kingship without father and brother --- Bharata calls Kaikeyi salt in wound --- Bharata calls mother family death-night --- Kausalya treated Kaikeyi like sister in dharma --- Bharata asks why guiltless Rama was exiled --- Bharata says he cannot guard kingdom without Rama --- Bharata vows to fetch brother from forest --- Bharata roars in grief like cave lion
